---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Hollywood Time"
  description="Learn about Hollywood Time, our independent editorial mission, our Los Angeles newsroom, and our commitment to entertainment journalism."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-black">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-900 font-bold">About Us</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="border-b-2 border-zinc-950 pb-6 mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-red-600 block mb-2">Our Story & Newsroom</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-headline tracking-tight uppercase text-zinc-950">
        About Hollywood Time
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg font-serif text-zinc-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        The definitive independent digital authority on cinema, streaming television, awards season analysis, and entertainment culture.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content Body -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-zinc-800 font-sans leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          Founded in Los Angeles, California, <strong>Hollywood Time</strong> was established to provide readers with authoritative, unfiltered, and deeply analytical coverage of the entertainment ecosystem. In an era saturated with press releases and algorithmic aggregation, Hollywood Time offers measured critical discernment, investigative reporting, and firsthand industry insight.
        </p>
        <p>
          From the festival circuits of Venice, Cannes, and Telluride to the soundstages and boardrooms of Burbank and Culver City, our journalists chronicle the creative and corporate forces shaping global storytelling.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">Editorial Independence</h2>
        <p>
          Hollywood Time maintains absolute editorial independence. Our reviews, reporting, investigative features, and awards handicapping are produced without editorial influence from studios, streaming networks, talent agencies, or commercial sponsors.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our critics and reporters adhere to the highest standards of journalistic ethics codified in our <a href="/editorial-policy" class="text-red-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Editorial Policy</a>, including strict transparency on gifts, travel junkets, and studio relationships.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">Editorial Masthead</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <a href="/author/ak-singh" class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-zinc-950 hover:text-red-600 transition">
                A.K. Singh
              </a>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">✓ VERIFIED</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-red-600 font-bold mt-1">Editor-in-Chief & Chief Film Analyst</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-2">Leads investigative coverage of global studio acquisitions, tentpole franchise strategy, and festival world premieres.</p>
            <a href="/author/ak-singh" class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-800 hover:text-red-600 underline block mt-2">View Profile & Articles →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <a href="/author/bidyanand" class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-zinc-950 hover:text-red-600 transition">
                Bidyanand
              </a>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">✓ VERIFIED</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-red-600 font-bold mt-1">Executive Awards & Cinema Editor</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-2">Specializes in Academy Awards handicapping, auteur criticism, and festival juried competitions across Venice and Cannes.</p>
            <a href="/author/bidyanand" class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-800 hover:text-red-600 underline block mt-2">View Profile & Articles →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <a href="/author/sk-singh" class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-zinc-950 hover:text-red-600 transition">
                S.K. Singh
              </a>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">✓ VERIFIED</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-red-600 font-bold mt-1">Television & Streaming Bureau Chief</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-2">Reports on showrunner overall deals, streaming subscriber economics, and the prestige television landscape.</p>
            <a href="/author/sk-singh" class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-800 hover:text-red-600 underline block mt-2">View Profile & Articles →</a>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <a href="/author/nk-mishra" class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-zinc-950 hover:text-red-600 transition">
                N.K. Mishra
              </a>
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">✓ VERIFIED</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-red-600 font-bold mt-1">Global Business & Culture Correspondent</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 mt-2">Covers Wall Street entertainment finance, stadium touring economics, haute couture fashion, and cinema preservation.</p>
            <a href="/author/nk-mishra" class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-800 hover:text-red-600 underline block mt-2">View Profile & Articles →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">Newsroom Headquarters</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600">
          <strong>Hollywood Time Media</strong><br />
          Sunset Boulevard & Vine Street<br />
          Los Angeles, CA 90028<br />
          United States<br />
          General Inquiries: <a href="mailto:contact@hollywoodtime.com" class="text-red-600 underline">contact@hollywoodtime.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
